# Check the chamber is at air and everything is off
# Turns the platen and shroud off, closes every valve, turns the turbo pump off and
# waits up to 30 s for the chamber to read more than 700 Torr. If it does not, the
# plan stops before any pump starts. It leaves the vacuum pump as it is. Put it
# first in a test that starts from ambient.
block begin at ambient
load rLACO

hvc platen off
hvc shroud off
hvc vent close
hvc fill close
hvc gate close
hvc turbo off
hvc foreline close
until chamberP > 700 within 30 s
